        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/977dab/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-22T09:08:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello! I'm sure I'm overlooking something somewhere but...</p><p>The Throwing Knives attack says \"This attack may attack two different targets.\" Does this require the player to split their attack dice between the two targets, or do the 3 attack dice (potentially) hit both targets?</p><p>Thanks for any help. Really enjoying this game (we've played a couple of skirmishes so far to get warmed up and get the rules ironed out... next stop is the Scenarios!)</p><p>Paul</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:35.121Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
