        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello! I&#39;m sure I&#39;m overlooking something somewhere but...</p><p>The Throwing Knives attack says &quot;This attack may attack two different targets.&quot; Does this require the player to split their attack dice between the two targets, or do the 3 attack dice (potentially) hit both targets?</p><p>Thanks for any help. Really enjoying this game (we&#39;ve played a couple of skirmishes so far to get warmed up and get the rules ironed out... next stop is the Scenarios!)</p><p>Paul</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
