        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"paulyg\"]\n\nHello! I&#39;m sure I&#39;m overlooking something somewhere but...The Throwing Knives attack says &quot;This attack may attack two different targets.&quot; Does this require the player to split their attack dice between the two targets, or do the 3 attack dice (potentially) hit both targets?Thanks for any help. Really enjoying this game (we&#39;ve played a couple of skirmishes so far to get warmed up and get the rules ironed out... next stop is the Scenarios!)Paul\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe one attack roll hits both targets. You don&#39;t have to split the dice. (Note that Aim and Attack +1 tokens only affect a single target as normal.)\n",
